# Vendor snapshot line-ending policy.
#
# This file overrides the snapshot's own `.gitattributes` (`* text=auto eol=lf`)
# for every path below `upstream/`, because rules in a shallower directory win
# over deeper ones. The snapshot is a byte-faithful copy of the official release
# archive, which ships CRLF in a few Windows scripts; recording it with `-text`
# keeps the committed bytes identical to the archive they came from.
* -text
